    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew damaniyeenya. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew haradam ea damanamuut aba Yerusalemu, ak gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Hefsiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji gea munyas sina eemoojiga, ghayi hoan NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghwadeas gicha heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda, ghayi nyarja Hesekiya was ghoan, ak gwadeeksa Baali heeda wagiida. Nea gwasin Ashera, gawuurji gidaghayi sinda Ahabu was sugoocheanda Israeli. Ak ghabwat miinga sean bea humng'eeda, nea gagadiiyeesa saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadeas heeda wagiida aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Nea ea gidaghayi rukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA gil gideaba, “Gaydayiin gheawungeasu jeeda Yerusalemu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadeas heeda wagiida bea miinga sean bea humng'eeda aba jeeda ghoorajeegiga asiyeenya bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghaghwarda orjeedaanyi gawuurji haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda. Ak ghabwar lagheanga, nea gwaramoorani ng'asheega, nea gabadiini giijoodiga, ea gadiyeeda beeneetkweanduumeeda. Ak gwasin ng'asheega saang'a munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghwanung' ghwanyareas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin sanaamooda Ashera, ak ghwayiin jeeda gheeda ghayi eesha NG'UTAMIIDA Dawdi ea Sulemani was orjeedaanyi, gideaba, “Jeedeaba gheawi ea Yerusalemu, ghayi aaloachi aba jeeda eemoojiga sean bea Israeli, gaydayiin gheawungeasu gidamanda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea maydanung' gwariteawa fuga Israeli jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi aadawji ghweaniga nyaawa, nyas ghoang'waay ng'asheega sean ghayi earukusi nea ghoang'waay deaweedajeega sean, ghayi rukusa Musa was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara ada mooleeysiiniit, ak Manase ghwanung' goodiiy ak gwasin gea munyas, nea ghwanaawa gea eemoojiga ghayi gul uhuuda NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeeda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabalool NG'UTAMIIDA aba naweeda fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda was sibanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba Manase was sugoocheanda Yuda gwasin ng'asheanda ghayi bea fuga Amori damanda miighwahina niny, ak ghwanung' gwasin riing'eeda fuga Yuda, aba badayda sanaamooda sigadoowani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aba badaydeaba nih gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli; Ng'ula gaydeadu Yerusalemu ea Yuda ng'asheega munyas ama inyas ghwayiiy giliwas sih gwadukuta iidigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydalas uhuuda Yerusalemu, gawuurji gideahindi Samariya ea gideahindi Ahabu was sugoocheanda Israeli ea jeacheangaaschi. Ak gaydeahuun Yerusalemu ea fugaaschi, gawuurji gweeriida siihuun ak geekula ghuuta ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydajakta boosteanga heareegeasu, ak ghaadawji weajoodiga nyaawa. Ak gayghoah easanga ea fuga ng'uta aba heeda weajoodiga nyaawa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba nisin gea munyas aba madeedeanyu nea ghoanyareasan, ghang'eada damanda ghayi rinna ghweaniga nyaawa ng'eanyiida Misri ea ghoah ghamneawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase ghabwar fuga saang'a muuchi mandeawana giidiinyeanda. Ea ghwanyiit meadajeega sean bea Yerusalemu foojeanda, ghang'eada meatkweeni ea gagul meatkweeda niirja, ea ghwanaawa giidiinyeandaanyi ghayi nung' goodiiy fuga Yuda, ak gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean bea Manase sin, ea giidiinyeandaanyi ghayi adiiy. Heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu ghami Manase ak geebung'sa jeeda shiidaneadaanyi, was shiidaneeda ghayi bea Usa. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda orjeedaanyi was Amoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amoni was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea iyeenya. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew iyeenya aba Yerusalemu, ghaamwat geeguura Meshulemeti was hudeaba Yotaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gidaghayi sinda Manase was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghwaat naweeda sean ghayi aat ghwaan, ak gagadiiyeesa sanaamooda ghayi gadiyeesa ghwaan nea ghabwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung'wa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweanigaaschi, nea mwaada naweeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamwaal fuga gadiyeeda bea Amoni niny ak geenuus sugoocheanda aba jeedeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwar fuga ng'eanyiida fugiga sean ghayi bwar Amoni was sugoocheandean, ak geenung' gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda orjeedaanyi was Yosiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Amoni heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geebung'sa heeda bung'eadaanyi mida jeeda shiidaneeda Usa. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda orjeedaanyi was Yosiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
